  "attribution": "BattleMainCB2 calls gBattleMainFunc() once per frame, so HandleAction_UseMove runs alone in its frame and ends with gCurrentActionFuncId = B_ACTION_EXEC_SCRIPT (battle_util.c:291); the move script's first opcode runs on the NEXT frame (HandleAction_RunBattleScript, battle_util.c:92-96, one opcode per frame). Every Random() observed on that 0->10 frame is therefore a GetMoveTarget draw -- HandleAction_UseMove's only other Random() sites (:161, :220) are BATTLE_TYPE_DOUBLE-gated. Each count is measured twice: the ROM's own sRandCount delta AND an independent replay of gRngValue's LCG; the probe refuses to write if they ever disagree.",
